SUMMARY:Family Movie Night: Zootopia 2
DTSTAMP:20260718T051329Z
DTSTART:20260717T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Experience the mystery and fun of Zootopia 2 at our free movie 
	night! \nNo outside alcohol or furniture is allowed\; park furniture will 
	be available and alcohol can be purchased from park concessionaires. Visit
	 Hearsay Levy Park\, Kind Ice Cream\, and Gaspachos Mexican Bites for food
	\, drinks\, and sweet treats for both you and your pet. \nAbout Zootopia 2
	 (PG): Detectives Judy Hopps and Nick Wilde investigate a mysterious repti
	le—Gary De’Snake—who threatens the mammal metropolis. To clear their names
	 and crack the case\, the duo must go undercover and explore new\, unexpec
	ted parts of town where their partnership is tested\n\nhttps://www.levypar
	khouston.org/events/family-movie-night-zootopia-2/\n\nFrom Levy Park Houst
	on
URL:https://www.levyparkhouston.org/events/family-movie-night-zootopia-2/
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:levy-park-houston
CATEGORIES:Levy Park Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT
